<title>SWITZERLAND: Von Roll gets contracts worth 30 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Von Roll gets contracts worth 30 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>GERLAFINGEN, Switzerland 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Von Roll Holding AG said it had received contracts worth nearly 30 million Swiss francs for waste processing plants.</p>
<p>One contract is for a plant to handle household trash according to European Union norms for the Czech city of Liberec, Von Roll said in a statement.</p>
<p>The other is a hazardous waste facility to be built for 3M in St Paul, Minnesota.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
